# Repo-level Prettier scope. `server/` carries its own .prettierignore.
#
# This file exists because `validate:format` makes formatting a CI gate; anything a
# generator owns must be listed here or the generator and Prettier will disagree and
# fail every commit that touches it.

node_modules
package-lock.json

# Build outputs
cli/dist
server/dist
coverage

# Generated by `pyrefly check --update-baseline`, which emits its own sorted/formatted
# JSON. Prettier re-indents it, so the tool's output and the committed file disagree.
# Same class as server/.prettierignore's resources/gates/_index.md — the generator owns
# the formatting.
hooks/.pyrefly-baseline.json
